# The CPU dry run's stand-in for release/flash-next-v3/settings.env (C798, registry Q1395): the preset's context,
# sampling and speculative flags on a random-weight qwen4exp model with one MTP block (test-llama-archs --mtp-draft,
# with Flash-Next's tokenizer and chat template), on the CPU. The CUDA settings and the nine-card split are left out.
PRESET_MODEL=qwen4exp-moe-mtp.gguf
PRESET_DRAFT=qwen4exp-moe-mtp-draft.gguf
PRESET_ENV=""
PRESET_ARGS="-ngl 0 -t 4 -fa on -c 65536 -np 1 -bs --ctx-checkpoints 4 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --reasoning-format deepseek --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0 -b 2048 -ub 512 --spec-type draft-mtp --spec-draft-n-max 3 --spec-draft-n-ubatch 128"
